<title>FINLAND: NOVO SHARE TO BROKERS' LIST ON JULY 21 - BOURSE.</title>
<headline>NOVO SHARE TO BROKERS' LIST ON JULY 21 - BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading of Finnish information technology company Novo's shares will begin on the Brokers' list on Monday, July 21, the Helsinki Stock Exchange said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The shares of Novo Group Ltd will be traded on the Brokers' list starting from 21 July 1997,&quot; the bourse said.</p>
<p>The round lot is 100 shares and the nominal value of the share is five markka, it said.</p>
<p>Novo Group was known as KT-Tietokeskus until May 1, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
